			<summary lang="de">Basiert auf dem original Arctic: Zephyr Skin von jurialmunkey und Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded Skin von beatmasterrs.</summary>
			<summary lang="en">Based on the original Arctic: Zephyr skin by jurialmunkey and Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded  skin by beatmasterrs.</summary>
			<summary lang="es">Basado en el original Arctic: Zephyr skin por jurialmunkey y Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded skin por beatmasterrs.</summary>
			<summary lang="fr">Basé sur le skin original Arctic: Zephyr par jurialmunkey et Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded par beatmasterrs.</summary>

			<description lang="de">Arctic: Zephyr - Rounded basiert auf dem original Arctic: Zephyr Skin von jurialmunkey und Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded Skin von beatmasterrs.</description>
			<description lang="en">Arctic: Zephyr - Rounded is based on original Arctic: Zephyr skin, created by jurialmunkey and Arctic: Zephyr Reloaded  skin by beatmasterrs.</description>
			<description lang="es">Arctic : Zephyr - Rounded se basa en la skin original Arctic : Zephyr, creada por jurialmunkey y Arctic : Zephyr Reloaded por beatmasterrs.</description>
